This project uses independent open-source dependencies under their respective
licenses, including Spring, Gradle, PostgreSQL, React, Vite, the OpenAI Java SDK,
the PayPal Java Server SDK, and Decionis AgentSafe / Agent Safe Pipeline.
The project license does not replace their license terms or grant trademark rights.

The web app also uses AG Grid Community (MIT) for the payments ledger, and the
Bryntum Scheduler trial for the payment schedule. The Bryntum trial is a
commercial evaluation package, not open source: it is installed from npm under
Bryntum's own terms, is not distributed in this repository, and shows a trial
notice. A licensed Bryntum build replaces it by changing one package alias.

The spend dashboard uses AG Studio, which brings AG Grid Enterprise and AG Charts
Enterprise. These are commercial packages installed from npm under AG Grid's own
terms and not distributed in this repository. Without a licence key
(AG_STUDIO_LICENSE_KEY) they run as an evaluation with a watermark. The dashboard's
OpenAI Responses adapter is AG Studio's published documentation example.

Dependency versions are recorded in Gradle manifests and npm lockfiles.
AgentSafe's Presence types override is documented in docs/security-and-reliability.md.
Product names identify integrations and do not imply endorsement.
